{
    "info":  {
                 "_postman_id":  "mini-ecommerce-api-collection",
                 "name":  "Mini E-commerce API",
                 "description":  "Postman collection for testing the Mini E-commerce backend APIs. Uses the Mini E-commerce - Local environment.\n\n**Authentication note:** The Admin Categories, Admin Products, and Cleanup requests require authentication. Spring Security has been enabled, but JWT authentication has not been implemented yet. These requests currently return 401 Unauthorized when executed. JWT authentication and Bearer Token configuration will be added in a subsequent PR.",
